// Minimal UI bundle startup smoke fixture
// Purpose: Validate compiled UI bundle loading and component metadata
// Requirements: 4.2, 8.1, 13.4, 13.5

// This is the simplest possible UI component that triggers compiled UI bundle emission.
// It has no interactivity, no complex layout, no state - just enough to validate
// that the native runtime can load and parse a compiled UI bundle.

component MinimalUI():
    render <panel title="UI Startup Smoke">
        <label>UI bundle loaded successfully</label>
    </panel>
